    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Two years ago, Vance Hinds weighed 215 kilogrammes. Then, in only 14 months, he had lost 91 kilogrammes. The 55-year-old man shared a video of his weight-loss journey online. The video has been viewed 24 million times. People have been amazed at his success."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It all began when Hinds was listening to his favourite radio programme, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Joe Rogan Experience"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", one day. Bert Kreischer, a regular host on the programme, said he had lost 18 kilogrammes in two months. He went on to call on people to challenge him. “Of the four regular hosts of the programme, Bert is my favourite. He is one of my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "idols",
            "ref": "v-idol"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” said Hinds. “He used to be very fat. If he could successfully lose weight, then I can, too.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The next morning, Hinds posted a picture of himself standing on a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scale",
            "zh": "秤"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at 215 kilogrammes. “Well, that’s the starting point,” he wrote. Every day, Hinds shared his weigh-ins, workouts, and meals online. Encouragement from his friends and family helped to keep him going."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Today, Hinds is no longer the guy on the metro that no one wants to sit next to. The man has become more confident. “At a certain point, you become "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "invisible",
            "ref": "v-invisible"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” Hinds talked about his size in the past. “You look at people, and they look away. Friends make fun of you. Stores don’t carry your size.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people who have lost weight later "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "regain",
            "ref": "v-regain"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it. Is Hinds worried about this problem? “People are saying I’m a role model for them,” the man said. “If I regain weight, I’ll let down all those people!”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
